{
    "title": "Hello Neighbor Nicky's Diaries",
    "description": "Hello Neighbor: Nicky\u2019s Diaries is the ultimate Hello Neighbor game built from the ground up for mobile devices. Some say he\u2019s a killer, that he hides kidnapped children in his basement. All you know is he\u2019s your Neighbor, and it\u2019s up to you to figure out what he\u2019s hiding. Nicky\u2019s Diaries follows Nicky\u2019s in-depth quest of figuring out what Mr. Peterson is hiding. \r\n\r\nA multitude of puzzles awaits.\r\n\r\nTo unlock the secrets of Nicky's past, you'll need to solve intricate puzzles and utilize objects hidden throughout the environment. Sneak past CCTV cameras, disable motion detectors around the doors and improvise with multiple tools at your disposal.\r\n\r\nEquip yourself.\r\n\r\nUtilize JUMP BOOTS to reach higher vantage points, X-RAY GLASSES to locate the Neighbor and sneak past him, EMP devices to disable traps, and no Neighbor game would be complete without throwing jugs of glue.\r\n\r\nPrepare for the BASEMENT.\r\n\r\nTake a deep breath and brace yourself before entering the basement, as there is more there than meets the eye.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hello Neighbor: Nicky\u2019s Diaries is the ultimate Hello Neighbor game built from the ground up for mobile devices. Some say he\u2019s a killer, that he hides kidnapped children in his basement. All you know is he\u2019s your Neighbor, and it\u2019s up to you to figure out what he\u2019s hiding. Nicky\u2019s Diaries follows Nicky\u2019s in-depth quest of figuring out what Mr. Peterson is hiding. <br><br>A multitude of puzzles awaits.<br><br>To unlock the secrets of Nicky&#39;s past, you&#39;ll need to solve intricate puzzles and utilize objects hidden throughout the environment. Sneak past CCTV cameras, disable motion detectors around the doors and improvise with multiple tools at your disposal.<br><br>Equip yourself.<br><br>Utilize JUMP BOOTS to reach higher vantage points, X-RAY GLASSES to locate the Neighbor and sneak past him, EMP devices to disable traps, and no Neighbor game would be complete without throwing jugs of glue.<br><br>Prepare for the BASEMENT.<br><br>Take a deep breath and brace yourself before entering the basement, as there is more there than meets the eye.",
